<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Intrawest rated buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Intrawest rated buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston said analyst David Anders initiated coverage of Intrawest Corp with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- shares rose 1/4 to 14 on the New York Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>-- analyst not immediately available.</p>
</text>
